; ==============================================================================
; Pathfile: res://src/Infrastructure/UI/main_menu.tscn
; Description: Visual scene layout for the Tactile Glassmorphic Main Menu.
;              Defines backgrounds, dynamic title positions, menu card nodes,
;              and incorporates the full destructive warning confirmation modal.
;              Corrected HBoxContainer nesting paths and stripped UIDs.
; Author: Enrique González Gutiérrez
; Email: enrique.gonzalez.gutierrez@gmail.com
; ==============================================================================

[gd_scene load_steps=19 format=3]

